{"id":"b868439bb717acf7","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-quotient-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Quotient Forcing","display":"df-zfc-quotient-forcing — ZFC Quotient Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-quotient-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-quotient-forcing","58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-quotient-forcing — ZFC Quotient Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-quotient-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-quotient-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-quotient-forcing</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-quotient-forcing — ZFC Quotient Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a09d0af953c6995e\" href=\"?note=a09d0af953c6995e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-quotient-poset\">58-df-zfc-quotient-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{P}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb{P}\\in V\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\">\\(1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\\)</span> (forcing order and top condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\">\\(G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\)</span> (filter parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathbb{P}\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathbb{P}\\)</span> (quotient forcing defined by the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q,r\\in\\mathbb{P}\">\\(p,q,r\\in\\mathbb{P}\\)</span> (conditions bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S\\)</span> (canonical quotient-poset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientForcing}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quotient carrier is the canonical set of conditions compatible with every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> in the explicitly supplied forcing order.</li>\n<li>The forcing-prefixed name is an alias of the canonical predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-quotient-poset","status":"resolved","id":"a09d0af953c6995e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-quotient-poset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb{P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathbb{P}","display":false},{"tex":"p,q,r\\in\\mathbb{P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientForcing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientForcing}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1557,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3213","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-quotient-forcing.md|58-df-zfc-quotient-forcing]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a09d0af953c6995e"]}